'''Ripper''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 29th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance==
Its blade is made up of dark colored bricks with silver spikes attached to it, going over the lime green edge. The guard is silver, and the handle is solid black with silver points.

== Trivia==
*It has a [[Ripper (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

